<title>JAPAN: Stock ratings list-Okasan Research (Jan 21).</title>
<headline>Stock ratings list-Okasan Research (Jan 21).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Follows is a list of ratings on Tuesday by Okasan Seecurities Research Institute Inc.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Rated higher:</p>
<p>Hitachi Metals Ltd -- &quot;2S&quot; from &quot;3&quot;</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>First time rated:</p>
<p>Sankyu Inc -- &quot;2S&quot;</p>
<p>Ishikawajima Transport Machinery Co Ltd -- &quot;2S&quot;</p>
<p>Seed Co Ltd -- &quot;2S&quot; --------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Rating unchanged:</p>
<p>Paris Miki Inc -- &quot;1&quot;</p>
<p>Tohoku Misawa Homes Co Ltd -- &quot;2B&quot;</p>
<p>Ryohin Keikaku Co Ltd -- &quot;2B&quot;</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The research institute assigns ratings as follows:</p>
<p>&quot;1&quot; - issues expected to outperform the TOPIX by more than 10 percentage points over the next six months.</p>
<p>&quot;2B&quot; - issues expected to outperform the TOPIX within a 10 percentage point range over the next six months.</p>
<p>&quot;2S&quot; - issues expected to underperform the TOPIX within a 10 percentage point range over the next six months.</p>
<p>&quot;3&quot; - issues expected to underperform the TOPIX by more than 10 percentage points over the next six months.</p>
</text>
